OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader vows to fight no-
OL,4,Aconfidence vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader who has only been in
OL,7,Fpost since May has pledged to fight an
OL,8,Fattempt to oust her.
OL,10,FOpposition parties at Luton Borough
OL,11,FCouncil joined forces to challenge the
OL,12,Fleadership of Labour's Tahmina Saleem.
OL,14,FIt follows the departure from her party
OL,15,Fof eight councillors, most of whom have
OL,16,Fjoined the authority's Independent
OL,17,FAlliance.
OL,19,FSaleem said the motion to force her out
OL,20,Fwas "not what residents voted for".
